# Smolweb gate-2 headed receipt: a real Gemini status-10 response becomes an
# in-app prompt. Submitting it refetches through the actor, then the retained
# actor body spawns and composites without a second document request.
# Network-dependent by design; run on a fresh scratch root.
settle 30
key escape
open gemini://kennedy.gemi.dev/search
settle 60
assert visible
assert omnibar open
assert suggestions >= 1
assert event smolweb-input-requested
capture 01_gemini_input_prompt

type gemini protocol
key enter
settle 60
assert omnibar closed
assert focused gemini%20protocol
assert event smolweb-input-submitted
act Toggle live content
settle 60
assert content-live
assert surface content
capture 02_gemini_search_results
log smolweb Gemini input receipt complete
